config PWM_CSK6001
	bool "CSK6001 PWM driver"
	depends on HAS_CSK6001
	select HAS_CSK6001_GPT
	default y
	help
	  This option enables the PWM driver for CSK6001. Say y if you wish to use PWM port on CSK6001.
